# Tests for the Form_w2s module

Run with `clerk test`. Named scopes with the concrete numbers of issue #12,
worked out by hand from the Direct File definitions quoted in
`catala/form_w2s.catala_en`. The oracle comparison is
`make difftest SCOPE=form_w2s`.

> Using Types
> Using Form_w2s as W
> Using Params_2024 as P

